#: ../../language/error_codes/E0084.md:1
msgid "E0084"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0084.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `unqualified_record`"
msgstr "警告名称：`unqualified_record`"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0084.md:5
msgid ""
"A struct literal bound directly by a `let` has no explicit `T::` type "
"prefix. Even when a binding annotation identifies the type, keeping the "
"prefix on the literal makes the constructed type explicit."
msgstr ""
"由 `let` 直接绑定的结构体字面量没有显式的 `T::` 类型前缀。即使绑定上的类型标注已经确定了类型，在字面量上保留前缀也能明确所构造的类型。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0084.md:9
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0084.md:11
msgid ""
"The type annotation identifies the struct type, but the literal itself "
"remains unqualified:"
msgstr "类型标注指明了结构体类型，但字面量本身仍未带限定："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0084.md:14
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub struct Point {\n"
"  x : Int\n"
"  y : Int\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn origin() -> Point {\n"
"  let point : Point = { x: 0, y: 0 }\n"
"  point\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0084.md:18
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修改建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0084.md:20
msgid ""
"Prefix the literal with the struct type and let the binding type be "
"inferred."
msgstr "请为字面量加上结构体类型前缀，并让绑定的类型通过推断得出。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0084.md:22
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub struct Point {\n"
"  x : Int\n"
"  y : Int\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn origin() -> Point {\n"
"  let point = Point::{ x: 0, y: 0 }\n"
"  point\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
